tterns in Malagasy vertebrates</article-title><source>Proc Natl Acad Sci USA</source><year>2005</year><volume>102</volume><fpage>6587</fpage><lpage>6594</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">15851666</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1073/pnas.0502092102</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B12"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Tattersall</surname><given-names>I</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Madagascar's lemurs: cryptic diversity or taxonomic inflation?</article-title><source>Evolutionary Anthropology</source><year>2007</year><volume>16</volume><fpage>12</fpage><lpage>23</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1002/evan.20126</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B13"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Myers</surname><given-names>N</given-names></name><name><surname>Mittermeier</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name><name><surname>Mittermeier</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name><name><surname>da Fonseca</surname><given-names>G</given-names></name><name><surname>Kent</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Biodiversity hotspots for conservation priorities</article-title><source>Nature</source><year>2000</year><volume>403</volume><fpage>853</fpage><lpage>858</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">10706275</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1038/35002501</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B14"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Schmid</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Kappeler</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Sympatric mouse lemurs (<italic>Microcebus </italic>spp.) in western Madagascar</article-title><source>Folia Primatol</source><year>1994</year><volume>63</volume><fpage>162</fpage><lpage>170</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">7750864</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1159/000156812</